      en: ["Newbridge Silverware has been manufacturing in the town since 1934.", "The Pfizer plant in Newbridge is a major global site for tablet manufacturing.", "Whitewater Shopping Centre is one of the largest shopping malls in Ireland.", "The town is a major hub on the M7 motorway and the Dublin-Cork railway line.", "It is located adjacent to the Curragh, Ireland's premier horse racing venue.", "Newbridge historically grew as a major cavalry station for the military."],
