      en: ["Mullingar is located on the Royal Canal, a major greenway for leisure and tourism.", "It houses the national Lidl Regional Distribution Centre, employing hundreds of people.", "The Mullingar Business and Technology Park is a key IDA Ireland strategic site.", "The town is a major hub on the N4 road and the Dublin-Sligo rail line.", "Mullingar historically served as a significant market for the beef and dairy trade.", "It is a leading administrative centre for the Midlands region of Ireland."],
