      en: ["Strategic central location on the M6 motorway between Dublin and Galway.", "A key hub for global pharmaceutical and medical device corporations.", "Close academic partnership with the Technological University of the Shannon (TUS).", "Alkermes and PPD are among the largest employers in the region.", "Athlone is located geographically almost exactly in the center of Ireland.", "The population of Athlone exceeds 21,000 residents."],
